Quick Access's design previews for Pindu launcher

adwaita.svg — the preview of Adwaita, Home with no design
Copyright (C) 2026 Pindu launcher contributors

Drawn for Pindu launcher by an AI agent (#721) as a schematic of the app's own Home: no
game art, no text, no logos. The previews of the shipped designs live in their own folders
under data/themes/, each covered by that folder's LICENSE.

